      {
        "Parameter": "PE_G___NotesType",
        "Kind": "Value",
        "Value": "Source set from Wine Guardian DS050 product page, Sentinel split spec sheet, current ducted split manual, and DS050 chassis-B CAD PDF. Modeled with one 10 in top supply collar, one 10 in back return collar, 1/4 in liquid and 1/2 in suction refrigerant connectors, and one 1/2 in condensate drain connector. Fan-coil airflow is 410 CFM free blow and 359 CFM at 0.20 in. w.g. external static. Heater and humidifier options were not modeled; manual lists 9.6 A heating current and 11.8 A minimum circuit size with heat option. Wine Guardian's current DS050 shop page contains conflicting max-capacity copy, so PE_M_PerfCool_CapacityRated was set to 6458 BTU/h from the additional-information table/spec sheet instead of the lower marketing blurbs."
      }
